## Why EuroZig when there is already ZSF?

The need for EuroZig arose when hosting Zigtoberfest. EuroZig focuses on hosting and supporting European Zig events and supporting the European Zig software ecosystem. ZSF's focus, on the other hand, is to build Zig itself.

## What is EuroZig's relationship to ZSF?

EuroZig is a separate organization. It is not "ZSF Europe". EuroZig does not receive regular funding from ZSF. However, there is some membership overlap between ZSF and EuroZig, and the establishment of EuroZig was closely aligned with ZSF.

## Can I donate to EuroZig if I want to support ZSF or Zig's further development?

Sadly, this is not possible. Currently, there is no way to make tax-deductible donations to Zig's development in Europe. Donations to EuroZig are tax-deductible in Germany and benefit European Zig events and the European Zig software ecosystem.
